{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は真夏の全国ツアー2016\n大阪城ホール初日公演だったよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/23/0058728/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに、15thシングルのメンバーでの\nツアーが開始致しました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の大阪城ホールは実は\n埋まっていなく、\n空席を見上げながら\n悔しい思いをメンバー一同しましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は、どの会場、\nどの日程も満員になりましたヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんありがとうございます( ;o; )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なライブに出来るように\n私たちも頑張ります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のライブは\nただただ緊張したよ〜ヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しちゃって、\n自分的にミスが多かったから\n気を付けようと肝に銘じました(> <)。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもお客さんのノリがとても良くて\n踊っていて素直に楽しかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた皆さん\n本当に有難う(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/23/0058728/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーTシャツ。\nあほ面でごめんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ前は髪の毛を\nぐりんぐりんに巻いていても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ後はほぼストレートになります(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/23/0058728/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かろうじて、ゆる〜い\nウェーブがかかってるくらい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです、\n髪の毛をストレートにしてしまうくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相当の汗っかきなので\nライブは大変なのです...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ中、\nなんかちーちゃん眩しいっ！\nキラキラ輝いてるっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と感じたら、\n多分それは汗がキラキラしてるからだと\n思われます。おそらく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしい...\n代謝が良過ぎてしまう..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうにかならないもんかね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「アップルパイ」back numberさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまホテルの部屋で\nback numberさんの曲を\nシャッフルして聞いてるんだ♡\nいま流れてるのはアップルパイ。\n歌詞がとても良い...！\nアップルパイっていう曲名なのに\n恋愛にぴったりとハマってて\n本当に凄い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/23/0058728/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"腕にほっぺのお肉が\nぷにっとなってる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br